      "side": 1,
      "message": "The entry guard on line 52 checks `planeIdx \u003e NumPlanes(planeConfig)` rather than `planeIdx \u003e\u003d NumPlanes(planeConfig)`. For 1-plane configs `(NumPlanes \u003d\u003d 1)`, `planeIdx \u003d 1` passes the guard. Previously, `kYUYV` fell through with `isSubsampledPlane \u003d false`, but now case `PlaneConfig::kYUYV`: sets `isSubsampledPlane \u003d true` unconditionally. Calling `PlaneSubsamplingFactors(PlaneConfig::kYUYV, Subsampling::k422, 1)` will therefore return {2, 1} instead of {0, 0} for a non-existent plane.",
