      "message": "When a caller draws a `kYUYV` `SkImage` with `SkTileMode::kDecal`, `SkImage_GaneshYUVA::asFragmentProcessor` maps `kDecal` to `GrSamplerState::WrapMode::kClampToBorder` and passes it to `GrYUVtoRGBEffect::Make`. Hitting `SkASSERT(false)` crashes debug builds on reachable public API usage.\n\nSo either support `kClampToBorder` directly in `GrYUVtoRGBEffect`\u0027s shader (by returning `half4(0)` when the snapped image-space coordinate falls outside packedSubset, matching Graphite\u0027s former decal handling) or remove `SkASSERT(false)` so `Make()` cleanly returns nullptr without crashing debug builds, and update the comment.",
